    given-names: Dnyanesh
    alias: chandewardnyanesh
repository-code: "https://github.com/chandewardnyanesh/linkedin-network-intelligence"
url: "https://chandewardnyanesh.github.io/linkedin-network-intelligence/"
abstract: >-
  Twelve Claude Agent Skills for researching, scoring and managing a LinkedIn
  professional network: configurable Ideal Connection Profiles, candidate
  discovery from authorised sources, a configurable 100-point scoring engine in
  which components with no inputs abstain rather than imputing a midpoint,
  engagement propensity with explicit confidence levels and observations kept
  separate from predictions, a networking CRM with a thirteen-status pipeline,
  lead intelligence that classifies opportunities as hypotheses with public
  evidence, draft-only connection notes, relationship follow-up cadence with
  repetition suppressed, content-to-audience attribution that states its own
  limits, funnel reporting that names unavailable metrics rather than
  estimating them, and a mandatory safety layer with eleven prohibited rules
  and an append-only audit trail. The bundle contains no sender, scheduler,
  scraper, browser driver or platform credential: it drafts and records, and
  every external action is performed by the human user.
keywords:
  - LinkedIn
  - Claude Agent Skills
  - agent skills
  - networking CRM
  - ideal customer profile
  - lead scoring
  - relationship management
